<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:52:43 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>从波士顿倾茶事件到 Flock 相机强烈反对，250 年来美国人的拒绝</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/flock-safety-surveillance-backlash-history-boston-tea-party/</link><description>从佛罗里达州到科罗拉多州，许多城市都在取消合同，36 个州的摄像头也遭到破坏，这促使首席执行官加雷特·兰利 (Garett Langley) 援引本·富兰克林 (Ben Franklin) 的说法。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295477169-e1790089510722.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:07:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/flock-safety-surveillance-backlash-history-boston-tea-party/</guid></item><item><title>凯文·沃什 (Kevin Warsh) 的加息如何暴露了美国经济的 2 速增长，人工智能和住房处于两极</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/fed-rate-hike-housing-debt-borrowing-costs/</link><description>他称 2% 的通胀率是“坚定、固定的目标”，但 10 年期国债收益率高于 5% 正在将抵押贷款利率推向 7%，并提高借贷成本。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295623560-e1790089205404.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:01:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/fed-rate-hike-housing-debt-borrowing-costs/</guid></item><item><title>微软和 Coinbase 的调查导致逮捕“EvilTokens”背后的骗子，这是一个由人工智能驱动的 DIY 网络钓鱼网络</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/microsoft-coinbase-phishing/</link><description>该骗局涉及在社交媒体上销售网络钓鱼工具包，让任何人都可以创建令人信服的虚假电子邮件。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2275807320.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/microsoft-coinbase-phishing/</guid></item><item><title>4 天工作制在 2020 年代的某个时候消失了，现在改为 6 天工作制</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/4-day-workweek-remote-coffee-badging/</link><description>Owl Labs 的 Frank Weishaupt 是“咖啡徽章”背后的远程工作思想领袖，他表示“广告牌日”和繁忙的周日标志着 2026 年的工作世界。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1088347818-e1790026098968.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/4-day-workweek-remote-coffee-badging/</guid></item><item><title>苹果的第一个 50 年：图表显示这家 iPhone 制造商如何成为价值 4.85 万亿美元的巨头</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/apple-first-50-years-history-iphone-mac-services-revenue-growth-timeline/</link><description>从数字上看，苹果公司已转型为全球消费科技巨头。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-175779374.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/apple-first-50-years-history-iphone-mac-services-revenue-growth-timeline/</guid></item><item><title>阿里巴巴表示，随着中国竞相追赶美国，它打造了“中国最强大的人工智能芯片”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/alibaba-powerful-ai-chip-xi-trump-us/</link><description>随着特朗普和习近平准备本周讨论全球人工智能竞赛，这家中国科技巨头还计划训练新的人工智能模型并扩大数据中心&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26265192364858-e1790082843650.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 13:36:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/alibaba-powerful-ai-chip-xi-trump-us/</guid></item><item><title>就在特朗普和习近平在白宫会面前几天，中国加强了对运往美国的芬太尼制造化学品的控制</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/china-xi-trump-fentanyl-precursor-drugs/</link><description>在美国多年来就芬太尼危机施压后，北京正在扩大限制&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26265429222039-e1790082315292.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 13:34:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/china-xi-trump-fentanyl-precursor-drugs/</guid></item><item><title>在一名俄罗斯寡头帮助支付小唐纳德·特朗普的奢华婚礼费用后，一名共和党参议员呼吁对小唐纳德·特朗普进行调查</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/donald-trump-jr-russian-oligarch-curtis-investigation/</link><description>参议员约翰·柯蒂斯呼吁国会调查小特朗普与其父亲的外交关系、商业往来和经济利益&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26265421153032-e1790083359177.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 13:34:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/donald-trump-jr-russian-oligarch-curtis-investigation/</guid></item><item><title>盖茨基金会和 MTN 推出人工智能孕产妇健康平台，到 2030 年覆盖尼日利亚 50 万名妇女，尼日利亚孕产妇死亡人数约占 30%</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/gates-foundation-mtn-launch-ai-maternal-health-platform-nigeria/</link><description>这项为期四年、耗资 2500 万美元的合作伙伴关系将人工智能工具与电话和连接接入结合起来，以减少可预防的孕产妇死亡。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1244569870-e1790013767664.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 13:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/gates-foundation-mtn-launch-ai-maternal-health-platform-nigeria/</guid></item><item><title>年利润从 20 亿美元增至 1120 亿美元：苹果公司如何转型其业务</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/from-2-billion-to-112-billion-annual-profit-how-apple-transformed-business-cfo/</link><description>苹果公司的财务演变揭示了首席执行官约翰·特努斯（John Ternus）在开启公司新篇章时所继承的基础。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2294352802.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 13:09:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/22/from-2-billion-to-112-billion-annual-profit-how-apple-transformed-business-cfo/</guid></item></channel></rss>